+# One Smart Experiment
+
+This lesson reframes entrepreneurship from a risky all-at-once leap into a sequence of small, practical experiments. A single gold dot travels through the lesson, branching into possible offers, passing through an AI-assisted toolkit, and resolving into one focused path: one useful thing, one real group, one realistic way.
+
+## Visual arc
+
+1. Replace the dramatic startup myth with a small first step.
+2. Show five approachable ways to begin.
+3. Separate what AI accelerates from the human qualities that create value.
+4. Frame AI as support for thoughtful testing, not a substitute for work.
+5. Preview the concrete outputs of the track.
+6. reduce the commitment to one smart experiment.
+7. Close on a memorable three-part question and a clear AI assist.
+
+The design uses SCLA navy, blue, and gold; large editorial type; crisp cards; and restrained line-and-node motion. No stock imagery is required.
