+# Design: One Smart Experiment
+
+## Direction
+
+Editorial, optimistic, and practical. The frame begins with the oversized word “ENTREPRENEUR” and a high-risk launch icon, then scales the idea down to a single gold experiment node. That node becomes the through-line connecting the rest of the lesson.
+
+## System
+
+- Canvas: 1920 × 1080, 16:9.
+- Palette: deep navy background, white and cultured-paper surfaces, SCLA blue for structure, and gold for decisions and progress.
+- Type: Proxima Nova with system sans-serif fallback; minimum body size 40px and labels 22px.
+- Layout: 120px frame padding, generous whitespace, and a consistent lower progress rail.
+- Motion: short eased entrances, line draws, card staggers, and one finite pulse. The composition is controlled by one paused, seekable GSAP timeline.
+
+## Beat treatments
+
+1. **The myth / the start:** a large “huge leap” launch collapses into a small gold dot labeled “start here.”
+2. **Experiments:** five offer cards orbit the dot, then align as a test sequence.
+3. **AI + human:** a split layout contrasts an AI toolkit with four human-value anchors.
+4. **Purpose:** the phrase “avoid the work” is crossed out; “move · think · test” locks into a forward path.
+5. **Track roadmap:** five milestones draw across a 30–90 day path.
+6. **Permission:** three intimidating commitments fade; “one smart experiment” remains.
+7. **Closing question:** three concentric rings resolve to USEFUL THING / REAL PEOPLE / REALISTIC WAY, with AI shown as the accelerator rather than the center.
+
+## Accessibility
+
+High-contrast text, no meaning conveyed by color alone, no rapid flashing, and all important copy remains within the safe area.
